<title>UK: Luebecker Hypo sets 200 mln mark Jan 2002 FRN.</title>
<headline>Luebecker Hypo sets 200 mln mark Jan 2002 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LUEBECKER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    23.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     6.25 BP   PAY DATE  L-20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.12    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    HAM	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
